[WE ARE HIRING: ASSOCIATE]

We are looking for a driven, talented, and highly motivated Associate to join our team at DBP Law Firm!

If you are a dedicated legal professional looking to elevate your career and grow with a professional, dynamic team, we invite you to apply.

Requirements:
• Bachelor's degree in Law from a reputable university;
• ⁠Holds a valid legal practice license (PERADI or equivalent);
• ⁠2–3 years of relevant working experience at a prominent law firm in Jakarta;
• ⁠In-depth knowledge of corporate law and litigation law;
• ⁠Experienced to assist and coordinate with prosecutors, police officers, and other government institutions is a must;
• ⁠Excellent verbal and written English; ability to handle client correspondence independently;
• ⁠Strong legal and analytical skills;
• ⁠High level of professionalism, integrity, and proactive work ethic.

How to Apply:
Submit your application (CV and Cover Letter) to:
📧 dbp@dbplaw.id

Email Subject:
(Your University) + (Position Applied) + (Corporate/Litigation)
Example: (Universitas Indonesia) + Associate + Corporate

⏳ Deadline: Apply before 25th November 2026

Only shortlisted candidates will be contacted for the next stage of the recruitment process.

For more details, visit:
🌐 www.dbplaw.id
📞 0811 3030 300 (WhatsApp/Call)
